# Architecture Router

Canon: `AGENTS.md` first, then current architecture docs.

Use when editing `src/shapez2_factory/**`.

Layer rules:

- `domain`: pure rules/value objects; no I/O, DB, UI, external APIs.
- `application`: use cases, DTOs, ports; no concrete adapter imports.
- `adapters`: implement ports; map external libraries; no business policy.
- `interfaces`: UI/CLI surfaces; call use cases, not adapter internals.
- `bootstrap`: wiring only.

Ports live under `application/ports/`. Use cases depend on protocols, not concrete classes.

Verify with focused tests for touched layer, then repo gates from `AGENTS.md`.

References: `documents/architecture/README.md`, `.cursor/rules/shapez2-core.mdc`.
